g01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: \tWhat was his job there? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Fred</span>:\tHe was a sailor. He moved to Vancouver, Canada in 1885. He was a well-loved swimming instructor. He was the first lifeguard at English Bay. Many people here were his students.", "id": 3, "time": "33900", "image": "engenn1le06ob03re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn1le06ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn1le06ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [{"content": [], "type": "tips"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}